@host = http://localhost:5080
@aliceId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@bobId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@aliceNewId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@bobNewId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
@unknownId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000ff
@commentToBob = 30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@internalComment = 30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

### Anonymous details (A-01): очікувано 401 після виправлення
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}
Accept: application/json

### Alice login; REST Client reads process environment
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "alice", "password": "{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}" }

### Own details (A-02)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}
Accept: application/json

### Foreign details with the same Alice cookie (A-03)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}
Accept: application/json

### Unknown id with the same Alice cookie (A-10)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{unknownId}}
Accept: application/json

### List as Alice (A-05)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents
Accept: application/json

### Foreign update with the same Alice cookie (A-04)
PUT {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Змінено Alice (PoC)", "description": "IDOR update PoC", "occurredAtUtc": "2026-08-02T10:00:00+00:00" }

### Foreign delete with the same Alice cookie (A-04)
DELETE {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobNewId}}

### Reporter triage — vertical escalation (A-06)
POST {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceNewId}}/triage

### Child: comment on Bob incident by direct id (A-12)
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/{{commentToBob}}
Accept: application/json

### Child: internal comment for Reporter (A-12)
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/{{internalComment}}
Accept: application/json

### Bob login changes current identity
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "bob", "password": "{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}" }

### Bob own details — state after Alice update
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}
Accept: application/json

### Morgan login; Analyst read
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "morgan", "password": "{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}" }

### Permitted Analyst read (A-03R)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}
Accept: application/json

### Analyst content update — матриця: 403
PUT {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Analyst edit", "description": "x", "occurredAtUtc": null }
